{"id":"56061e16f3fb8bfd","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-godel-numbering.md","title":"Gödel Numbering","display":"df-godel-numbering — Gödel Numbering","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-godel-numbering","aliases":["88-df-godel-numbering"],"display":"df-godel-numbering — Gödel Numbering","depends_on":["[[88-df-formula]]","[[./88-df-term]]","[[88-df-computable-function]]","[[88-df-numeral]]","[[88-df-decidable-set]]","[[88-df-substitution]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-godel-numbering"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-godel-numbering</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-godel-numbering — Gödel Numbering"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e14624569ca2194b\" href=\"?note=e14624569ca2194b\" title=\"88-df-formula\">88-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b768b53c62ab02de\" href=\"?note=b768b53c62ab02de\" title=\"./88-df-term\">88-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"64279ecae5246baf\" href=\"?note=64279ecae5246baf\" title=\"88-df-computable-function\">88-df-computable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" href=\"?note=69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" title=\"88-df-numeral\">88-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a6c52aed1a56207b\" href=\"?note=a6c52aed1a56207b\" title=\"88-df-decidable-set\">88-df-decidable-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a72f024d8daeb569\" href=\"?note=a72f024d8daeb569\" title=\"88-df-substitution\">88-df-substitution</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-godel-numbering-—-Gödel-Numbering-$\\ulcorner-\\cdot-\\urcorner$\">df-godel-numbering — Gödel Numbering <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner \\cdot \\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner \\cdot \\urcorner\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_S\">\\(E_S\\)</span> (tagged syntax objects, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e14624569ca2194b\" href=\"?note=e14624569ca2194b\" title=\"88-df-formula\">88-df-formula</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b768b53c62ab02de\" href=\"?note=b768b53c62ab02de\" title=\"./88-df-term\">88-df-term</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> (candidate Gödel coding)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Godel}_S(g)\">\\(\\mathrm{Godel}_S(g)\\)</span> (effective Gödel-numbering predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sub}_g\">\\(\\operatorname{sub}_g\\)</span> (code-level numeral-substitution function)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{len}_g,\\operatorname{entry}_g\">\\(\\operatorname{len}_g,\\operatorname{entry}_g\\)</span> (coded-sequence destructors)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}_k\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}_k\\)</span> (arity-indexed computability predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Decidable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Decidable}\\)</span> (decidable-set predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为一阶签名；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NumeralSignature}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{NumeralSignature}(S)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu_S\">\\(\\nu_S\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" href=\"?note=69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" title=\"88-df-numeral\">88-df-numeral</a>。本文件的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span> 在公式所属签名中解释为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu_S(n)\">\\(\\nu_S(n)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_i=v_i^S\">\\(v_i=v_i^S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(i\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sub}_g,\\operatorname{len}_g,\\operatorname{entry}_g\">\\(\\operatorname{sub}_g,\\operatorname{len}_g,\\operatorname{entry}_g\\)</span> 是与候选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 共同固定的三个候选部分函数图。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Godel}_S(g)\">\\(\\mathrm{Godel}_S(g)\\)</span> 相对于这组显式固定的辅助数据解释；下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 不声称未规定位置的函数值由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 唯一决定。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>项、公式、公式序列分别通过下述标签嵌入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\jmath_0,\\jmath_1,\\jmath_2\">\\(\\jmath_0,\\jmath_1,\\jmath_2\\)</span> 进入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_S\">\\(E_S\\)</span>。在每个已定型的位置，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(t),g(\\varphi),g(d)\">\\(g(t),g(\\varphi),g(d)\\)</span> 分别缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(\\jmath_0(t)),g(\\jmath_1(\\varphi)),g(\\jmath_2(d))\">\\(g(\\jmath_0(t)),g(\\jmath_1(\\varphi)),g(\\jmath_2(d))\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g[X]\">\\(g[X]\\)</span> 也按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 的语法类型使用同一嵌入。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>解码函数只要求在编码的有限公式序列及合法条目位置给出规定值；未规定位置仍允许部分性，不私自选择默认值。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathrm{Fml}_S^m,\n\\qquad\nE_S\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Term}_S\\sqcup\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\sqcup\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{&lt;\\omega}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathrm{Fml}_S^m,\n\\qquad\nE_S\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Term}_S\\sqcup\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\sqcup\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{&lt;\\omega}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\quad\\jmath_0(t)\\coloneqq\\langle0,t\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\quad\\jmath_1(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\langle1,\\varphi\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall d\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{&lt;\\omega}\\quad\\jmath_2(d)\\coloneqq\\langle2,d\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;E_S=(\\{0\\}\\times\\mathrm{Term}_S)\\cup(\\{1\\}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_S)\n\\cup(\\{2\\}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{&lt;\\omega}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\quad\\jmath_0(t)\\coloneqq\\langle0,t\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\quad\\jmath_1(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\langle1,\\varphi\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall d\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{&lt;\\omega}\\quad\\jmath_2(d)\\coloneqq\\langle2,d\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;E_S=(\\{0\\}\\times\\mathrm{Term}_S)\\cup(\\{1\\}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_S)\n\\cup(\\{2\\}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{&lt;\\omega}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Godel}_S(g)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{NumeralSignature}(S)\\land g:E_S\\to\\mathbb N\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall e_1,e_2\\in E_S\\;\n\\bigl(g(e_1)=g(e_2)\\to e_1=e_2\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Decidable}(g[E_S])\n\\land\\mathrm{Comp}_3(\\operatorname{sub}_g)\n\\land\\mathrm{Comp}_1(\\operatorname{len}_g)\n\\land\\mathrm{Comp}_2(\\operatorname{entry}_g)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\n\\forall i,n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{sub}_g(g(\\varphi),i,n)\n=g(\\varphi[\\bar n/v_i])\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall a,i,n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(\na\\notin g[\\mathrm{Fml}_S]\\to\\operatorname{sub}_g(a,i,n)=0\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\operatorname{len}_g(g(\\langle\\rangle))=0\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\forall(\\varphi_0,\\ldots,\\varphi_m)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{m+1}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{len}_g(g(\\langle\\varphi_0,\\ldots,\\varphi_m\\rangle))=m+1\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\land\\forall i\\leq m\\;\n\\operatorname{entry}_g(g(\\langle\\varphi_0,\\ldots,\\varphi_m\\rangle),i)=g(\\varphi_i)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Godel}_S(g)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{NumeralSignature}(S)\\land g:E_S\\to\\mathbb N\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall e_1,e_2\\in E_S\\;\n\\bigl(g(e_1)=g(e_2)\\to e_1=e_2\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Decidable}(g[E_S])\n\\land\\mathrm{Comp}_3(\\operatorname{sub}_g)\n\\land\\mathrm{Comp}_1(\\operatorname{len}_g)\n\\land\\mathrm{Comp}_2(\\operatorname{entry}_g)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\n\\forall i,n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{sub}_g(g(\\varphi),i,n)\n=g(\\varphi[\\bar n/v_i])\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall a,i,n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(\na\\notin g[\\mathrm{Fml}_S]\\to\\operatorname{sub}_g(a,i,n)=0\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\operatorname{len}_g(g(\\langle\\rangle))=0\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\forall(\\varphi_0,\\ldots,\\varphi_m)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{m+1}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{len}_g(g(\\langle\\varphi_0,\\ldots,\\varphi_m\\rangle))=m+1\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\land\\forall i\\leq m\\;\n\\operatorname{entry}_g(g(\\langle\\varphi_0,\\ldots,\\varphi_m\\rangle),i)=g(\\varphi_i)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner\\)</span> : 公式<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>的Gödel数</li>\n<li>将语法对象编码为自然数，使可计算性理论可用于语法</li>\n<li>使用带标签的不交和，避免同一个底层字符串同时作为项、公式或公式序列\n获得类型冲突；有限公式序列也被编码，供证明谓词使用。</li>\n<li>“有效”只施加在自然数上的范围判定、代入及序列解码函数上；不再把\n尚未编码的抽象语法对象直接作为 Turing 机输入来写<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}(g)\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}(g)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(\\varphi)\">\\(g(\\varphi)\\)</span>是元层数字；只有<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline{g(\\varphi)}\">\\(\\overline{g(\\varphi)}\\)</span>才是可代入\n对象语言公式的数词。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-godel-numbering-—-Gödel-Numbering-$\\ulcorner-\\cdot-\\urcorner$","text":"df-godel-numbering — Gödel Numbering $\\ulcorner \\cdot \\urcorner$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e14624569ca2194b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"./88-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"b768b53c62ab02de","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./88-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-computable-function","status":"resolved","id":"64279ecae5246baf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-computable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"69c0e9e2e8f423a6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-decid