ml}_S^{m+1}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{len}_g(g(\\langle\\varphi_0,\\ldots,\\varphi_m\\rangle))=m+1\\\\\n&\\hspace{8em}\\land\\forall i\\leq m\\;\n\\operatorname{entry}_g(g(\\langle\\varphi_0,\\ldots,\\varphi_m\\rangle),i)=g(\\varphi_i)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Comp}(g)","display":false},{"tex":"g(\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline{g(\\varphi)}","display":false}],"bytes":4111,"backlinks":[{"id":"ceae3257aec622e2","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$g$ (Gödel numbering, see [[88-df-godel-numbering]])"},{"id":"4d161ce567387339","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$g$ (Gödel numbering, see [[88-df-godel-numbering]])"},{"id":"268c5641ccf6ec59","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S$，$n\\in\\mathbb N$；变量编号使用本签名固定的 $v_i^S$。$\\operatorname{diag}_{g,x}$ 以下述图定义，调用的 $\\operatorname{sub}_g$ 与 [[88-df-godel-numbering]] 中共同固定的数据相同。"},{"id":"5946096a2536364f","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$g$ (Gödel numbering, see [[88-df-godel-numbering]])"},{"id":"9e711ddb72efdf50","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c7ab6c8e893872fb","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Godel}_S(g)$ (Gödel-numbering predicate, see [[88-df-godel-numbering]])"},{"id":"499d6d1436229742","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$g$ (Gödel numbering, see [[88-df-godel-numbering]])"},{"id":"254200a991dbb642","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6bf67ec77619bc8d","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$g$ (Gödel numbering, see [[88-df-godel-numbering]])"},{"id":"7b3fea2806e312f8","anchor